{"id":"1b1d9e4a-a596-40dc-a9bc-526118770b46","object":"chat.completion","created":1785038011,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\":\"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    distances = case['distances']\\n    edge_map = {}\\n    for u, v, d in distances:\\n        if u > v:\\n            u, v = v, u\\n        edge_map[(u, v)] = d\\n    edges = []\\n    for (u, v), d in edge_map.items():\\n        w = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        edges.append((w, u, v))\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    n = len(nodes)\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    def union(x, y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n    mst = []\\n    total = 0.0\\n    for w, u, v in edges:\\n        if union(u, v):\\n            mst.append([u, v, w])\\n            total += w\\n            if len(mst) == n - 1:\\n                break\\n    if len(mst) != n - 1:\\n        raise ValueError('input graph is disconnected')\\n    return {'mst_edges': mst, 'total_weight': total}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) that returns {\"mst_edges\": list of [node1, node2, weight], \"total_weight\": number}. Steps: compute core distances from case['core_distance'] dict; compute mutual reachability for each pair from case['distances'] list of [u, v, dist]; for each (u,v): weight = max(core_distance[u], core_distance[v], dist); then sort edges by (weight, u, v) where u<v canonical order; then